<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB two-week rev repo attracts no bids.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB two-week rev repo attracts no bids.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Monday it received no bids in its two-week reverse repo tender with maximum yield set at 16.2 percent.</p>
<p>The rate was unchanged from the previous tender on Thursday. The two-week Prague interbank offered rate ranged around 22 percent in Monday's early trading.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
